body:
Owner decision of 2026-09-28 evening, recorded by the orchestrator (journal #70, actor `owner-via-orchestrator`):

- agents may download and install libraries needed for the training task (recorded in `dependencies.md`);
- they must not block on details, must monitor GPU, RAM and disk, clean their own artifacts, and finish unattended;
- Q-LANG-1..7 and Q-DATA-7 (from the wild pilot) stay open for the owner's morning review; that night's experiment trains on the current language and the rebuilt formalizer-v1; recommendations are applied in the next data iteration unless the owner decides otherwise.

The owner then answered Q-LANG-1..7 and Q-DATA-7 the same evening (18:53Z, see the model-language topic) and put training on hold until the expanded data was final.

Seeded on 2026-09-29 from the journal and reports; the timestamp is that of the source event.
